  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Your health in your hands_Slovakia_C2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &apos;Your Health in Your Hands&apos; project addresses the high cancer mortality rates in Slovakia, with a particular focus on migrant women who face multiple barriers to accessing cancer prevention and screening services. By deploying trained health mediators in the field, the project seeks to enhance awareness, improve access, and encourage adherence to preventive practices. Through strong partnerships, community-based outreach, and the dissemination of vital health information, the initiative aims to drive lasting improvements in the health and well-being of migrant populations across Slovakia.</narrative>
  </description>
